{
  "meta": {
    "evaluator": "Gen-e2 Research Agent (expert review, single evaluator)",
    "date": "2026-08-17",
    "websiteApp": "NTUC Club Loyalty — Member PWA (apps/pwa)",
    "device": "Not executed on device. Static source review; layout and target metrics computed against a 390×844 CSS-pixel mobile viewport, the app's own --maxw being 480px.",
    "browserOS": "Not executed in a browser. Static review of React 18 / react-router-dom 6.28 / plain CSS source. Contrast ratios and control heights are computed from the stylesheet, not measured from a render.",
    "taskFeature": "Full existing product surface — all four routes: /login, / (dashboard), /rewards, /history — plus the shared app shell and tab bar.",

    "activity": "RA-10 — Heuristic evaluation and accessibility audit of the current PWA",
    "targetingGap": "G10",
    "priorityInPlan": "Low",
    "researchPlan": "gen-e2/discover/customer-app/01-research/02-research-plan.md",

    "framing": "This evaluates a prototype, not a product. apps/pwa/src is 993 lines across 10 files (607 of them the four page and shell components the research plan counts), and nine of the twelve Phase 1 member features in the product brief are absent — including the digital membership card, which is the instrument all three Phase 1 member journeys pivot on. The value of this evaluation is (a) a dated baseline to measure the real build against and (b) a read on the accessibility habits currently in the codebase before those habits are copied into 12 features. It is NOT a source of product direction. Where a finding is a consequence of an absent feature rather than a design decision, the issue text says so explicitly, and the reader must not treat the severity as a critique of the skeleton's design.",

    "whatWasEvaluated": [
      "apps/pwa/src/App.tsx — routing and the Protected shell",
      "apps/pwa/src/main.tsx — provider tree",
      "apps/pwa/src/context/AuthContext.tsx — session lifecycle",
      "apps/pwa/src/components/TabBar.tsx — persistent navigation",
      "apps/pwa/src/pages/LoginPage.tsx — sign-in and registration",
      "apps/pwa/src/pages/DashboardPage.tsx — balance, tier, recent activity",
      "apps/pwa/src/pages/RewardsPage.tsx — catalogue and redemption",
      "apps/pwa/src/pages/HistoryPage.tsx — points ledger",
      "apps/pwa/src/api/client.ts — error surfaces and data contract",
      "apps/pwa/src/styles.css — the whole visual layer (370 lines)",
      "apps/pwa/index.html and vite.config.ts — document head, manifest, service worker"
    ],

    "whatCouldNotBeEvaluated": [
      "The digital membership card (brief f1). It does not exist. It is the highest-stakes accessibility component in the product and the audit has no baseline for it. Forward-looking requirements are recorded in accessibility.absentComponentRequirements — they are requirements, not findings.",
      "Voucher wallet (f6), profile and consent (f9), parking entitlement (f8), promotions (f10), notifications (f11), multi-path enrolment (f2), expiry and reversal transparency (f4). Absent.",
      "Anything requiring execution: real screen-reader output (VoiceOver/TalkBack), real focus-ring rendering per browser, real reflow at 200% zoom, real service-worker offline behaviour, real safe-area insets on a notched device. Every claim below that would need a device is marked as a risk requiring verification, not as a confirmed failure.",
      "Localisation. NFR-010 (multi-language, Nice to Have) has no implementation and every string is hard-coded English."
    ],

    "formatNote": "gen-e2-output-format names .gen-e2.acc as the artefact for an accessibility review, but no .gen-e2.acc schema or gen-e2-accessibility skill exists in this workspace. RA-10 is a single activity producing both halves, so the WCAG 2.2 AA review is carried here as an `accessibility` extension block on the .gen-e2.he schema. The heuristics array and severityScale conform to the gen-e2-heuristic template exactly. Flagged for session review."
  },

