        "priority": "low",
        "criterion": "Best practice — no WCAG criterion",
        "screen": "TabBar.tsx:11 — <nav> with no accessible name",
        "observation": "The <nav> landmark is unnamed. With only one nav in the document this is not a failure, but it becomes one the moment a second navigation region is added (which f1's card route and f9's profile route will do).",
        "fix": "aria-label=\"Main\" on the tab bar nav, and name every landmark from the outset.",
        "confidence": "validated"
